  "note": "Two SYNTHETIC CloudTrail windows for CHK-06 CostDNA. Nothing here is a real bill: each window is a service graph with per-call costs, and the check generates events over it with a seeded mulberry32 PRNG, then walks each event from its leaf resource back to the owning team and asserts the attributed totals reconcile with the ledger. Consumed by components/checks/costdna.tsx (browser) and scripts/verify.mjs (build) — one source, two readers.",
  "algorithm": "rnd = mulberry32(seed); for each of N events: edge = edges[floor(rnd()*edges.length)]; base = costPerCall[edge.to]*(0.7+rnd()*1.4); spike = rnd()<0.05 ? 4+rnd()*4 : 1; cost = base*spike; ledger += cost; team = rootOf(edge.from).team (follow parents[0] until layer 0); teamUsd[team] += cost. Assert |ledger − Σ teamUsd| < 1e-9, |Σ shares − 100| < 1e-6, and rootOf(edge.from).team === node(edge.from).team for every event. N = 20000.",
